{"id":"n74131-1-9","stage":1,"title":"맵다 · 辣","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74131-1-9-1","ko":"음식 맛이 어때?","zh":"菜的味道怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음식","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b5aa8eb0e905a934808.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74131-1-9-2","ko":"좀 매운데. 후추를 너무 많이 넣었나 봐.","zh":"有点辣。看来是放了太多胡椒粉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매운데.","meaning":"辣","explanation":"맵다：辣；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"ent