1c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/146e970114982fb11681.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74131","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3435,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有点辣。看来是放了太多胡椒粉了。","我讲的话有那么有趣吗？","菜的味道怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有点辣。看来是放了太多胡椒粉了。","菜的味道怎么样？","我讲的话有那么有趣吗？"],"answer":0}]}
